Subject: Added riscv-spike.exp to run regression tests through SPIKE.

	* baseboards/riscv-spike.exp: New file.
---
 ChangeLog                  |  4 +++
 baseboards/riscv-spike.exp | 52 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 56 insertions(+)
